WEBVTT

00:09:29.336 --> 00:09:31.295
Moral bi biti tudi prostor za radovednost

00:09:31.295 --> 00:09:33.869
in postavljanje vprašanj

00:09:33.869 --> 00:09:36.512
in upam, da boste vsi vi moji zavezniki.

00:09:36.512 --> 00:09:38.759
KS: Hvala. To je bilo čudovito.
GR: Hvala.

00:09:38.759 --> 00:09:42.147
(Aplavz)